            "category": "description",
            "text": "Crypt::SecretBuffer versions before 0.019 for Perl is suseceptible to timing attacks.  For example, if Crypt::SecretBuffer was used to store and compare plaintext passwords, then discrepencies in timing could be used to guess the secret password.",
